  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Zhang",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Zhang.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Mike Zhang is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 56 877 690 071) (MED0001995875) consulting at the Earlwood & Bangor centres.",
      "Dr Mike Zhang studied at the University of New South Wales and graduated with a Bachelor of Medical Science and Doctor of Medicine. He worked at St George Hospital and Sutherland Hospital as well as other hospitals for 7 years before entering GP training. He has completed rotations through General medicine, Respiratory, Geriatrics, Orthopaedics, Urology & Paediatrics, as well as having worked more extensively in Emergency. He continues to gain experience in all aspects of family medicine and has a special interest in Children’s health.",
      "In his spare time Dr Mike enjoys travelling and spending time with his family and friends."
    ]
  },
